# Recommendation for next agent

Do NOT re-attempt this chunk standalone. Either:
1. First implement libjxl's missing counterweights (separate multi-week
   chunk; see `cost_model_wedge_analysis.md` and
   `dct32_mul_post_loss_fix_bisection.md` for prior bisection narratives).
2. OR build a screenshot-class discriminator and gate the e6 admission
   on it (smaller scope, but the existing smooth_photo discriminator is
   the WRONG direction — screenshots typically have HIGH mask1x1 values
   from anti-aliased text edges, not the LOW values that mark smooth
   photos).
3. OR accept the wedge persists and move to Chunk B (block context map
   under-clustering on screenshots, the e7 d=3-6 cluster — independent
   of this work).
